{
  "name": "Bright Fungal Cloak",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "value": "<p>While wearing this cloak, you can take a Bonus Action to furl or unfurl it. Unfurled, it sheds Bright Light in a 5-foot radius and Dim Light for an additional 5 feet.</p><p>One pound of edible fungus is sewn into a Bright Fungal Cloak. Once all of it has been eaten, the cloak becomes a mundane set of Traveler’s Clothes.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-Ya03k6zErKoag0U9\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p><em>Furl or Unfurl</em> puts the light on your token; remove the effect to furl the cloak.</p></section>"
    },
